NARRATOR: Kaelen finds a parallel corridor — intact but winding. He loses precious seconds but emerges unscathed.
Kaelthas: *distant* You'll never catch me through the main halls, Kaelen!
NARRATOR: Kaelen digs into the Archive's code, stabilizing the corridor for just long enough to sprint through.
SYSTEM: // Root Access applied: corridor stabilized for 3 seconds. GO!
NARRATOR: The Archive's entrance — the only way out. Kaelthas stands at the threshold, Fragment #4 glowing in his hand. He turns, eyes burning.
Kaelthas: The exit is locked. Of course it is. Fine then — if I can't run, I'll FIGHT.
Kaelthas: You want the fragment back? Come and take it.
SYSTEM: // BOSS FIGHT: KAELTHAS (Weakened)\n// HP: 200 | Phases: 2\n// Weakened from the chase — exploit his instability!
