Kaelthas: You think you've WON? I've already READ the fragment's data. The knowledge is INSIDE me now!
NARRATOR: PHASE 2: ARCHIVE EMPOWERED. Kaelthas draws power from the Archive itself — shelves collapse as he converts their data into attacks.
