~ _resolution
Kaelen: Kaelthas's methods are wrong. But his goal — overthrowing SOVEREIGN — is the same as mine.
Kaelen: Are we really that different?
Elara: Yes. You ARE different. Because you're questioning yourself. Kaelthas never questioned — he just grabbed for power.
Elara: That's the difference between fixing a mistake and repeating it.
Kaelen (Internal): The difference is doubt. Kaelthas never doubted. He saw power and he took it. I see power and I wonder if I deserve it. Maybe that doubt is the only thing standing between me and becoming exactly like him.
Lyra: He'll be back. People like that always come back. We should be ready.
SYSTEM: // Source Key Fragments: %d/7. Kaelthas status: ESCAPED.
